{"id":"npc:%E7%BD%97%E5%8D%97","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"自私的塔拉人，受煽动而投向“深池”，并继续煽动其他塔拉人，之后向“深池“透露了西尔莎的告密而得以加入“深池”。在小丘郡遭驻军脏弹轰炸后对旧时的邻居与灾民冷言相对，却使得小丘郡的居民们受琴柳的感召而再次联合。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情9-4 暗火四起等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_244.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_244.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_244.png"}],"appearances":[]}